      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We had Shahmeer come out very promptly, and told him what we wanted, we then went with the  4 kw and after 4 weeks, got a text message at 10pm on the Sunday night saying they would be here in the morning.  I wasn't happy about that.  They arrived about 8.45 and were here until about 2.30 - 3.00.  Then we found out they hadn't finished and needed to come back the next day. So, another day of no pay, thank you very much.  Anyway at the end of Tuesday, I then find out that the inverter wasn't available for installation and they would have to come back on the Friday.........another day off work, beautiful.....not.We are still waiting for our paperwork, one month later and thats about it.  All in all, I don't rate them for customer service.  We ordered a 4 kw system but they couldn't supply it, so they upgraded us to 5 kw, but that's not the point, I had a friend that had their 18 panels installed in 3 hours, not 3 days.Oh and Shahmeer also told us that we could have some of our panels installed on the back of the house - it faces southwest, but gets a lot of summer sun, the electrician wanted us to sign a waiver - what the hell is that all about.Also, we weren't advised that Western Power would charge us 160 bucks for a new meter in our power box, that was a nice surprise.I can't wait to see my next power bill in one month.",
